WEBVTT

00:00:04.390 --> 00:00:10.690
In this hut, I sojourn for the night,

00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:21.250
thanks to the generosity of the owner. On this night...

00:00:22.330 --> 00:00:29.710
the moon slices open the darkness...

00:00:29.710 --> 00:00:41.430
and illuminates the blossom of an eternal pledge.

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:47.050
Chapter Two

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:47.050
The Star-crossed Mound

00:01:06.970 --> 00:01:09.310
These boorish Tosa samurai...

00:01:09.310 --> 00:01:11.480
They sure hold themselves in high regard!

00:01:11.480 --> 00:01:13.270
Edo's now called Tokyo?!

00:01:13.270 --> 00:01:14.940
Balderdash!

00:01:45.850 --> 00:01:50.140
To survive as a samurai these days, you've got to turn to thievery...

00:01:50.930 --> 00:01:52.810
How's that making the world a better place?

00:02:21.130 --> 00:02:23.050
You wretches saw, didn't you?

00:02:52.200 --> 00:02:53.200
<i>This man as well?!</i>

00:02:53.450 --> 00:02:54.210
<i>Roger!</i>

00:02:54.210 --> 00:02:55.000
<i>Head out!</i>

00:03:34.830 --> 00:03:35.870
Who might you be?

00:03:48.390 --> 00:03:51.430
I-I'm Ooka Daizou from Tosa.

00:03:52.220 --> 00:03:55.390
Feed... Feed me.

00:03:56.520 --> 00:03:57.980
As you wish.

00:04:00.980 --> 00:04:03.280
Please enter.

00:04:17.790 --> 00:04:20.210
What's wrong with this woman?

00:04:20.210 --> 00:04:24.840
Even though she saw me holding a bloody sword, the color of her face didn't change at all.

00:04:25.420 --> 00:04:26.710
Here is your portion.

00:04:30.590 --> 00:04:32.050
It doesn't matter.

00:04:32.050 --> 00:04:37.310
When dawn breaks, I'll find a chance to slay her. Then I'll take all her valuables and leave.

00:04:38.020 --> 00:04:42.110
Please feel free to rest here for the night.

00:04:42.110 --> 00:04:45.690
However, I have one stipulation.

00:04:45.690 --> 00:04:46.730
What?

00:04:47.650 --> 00:04:49.360
There lies...

00:04:49.360 --> 00:04:51.450
a room deep within the house.

00:04:52.240 --> 00:04:55.410
This is where I repose,

00:04:55.410 --> 00:04:57.950
and is always unsightly.

00:04:58.580 --> 00:05:02.330
I request that you never glance inside.

00:05:03.250 --> 00:05:05.460
No matter what your reason may be,

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:07.300
you must not peer inside.

00:05:39.160 --> 00:05:40.910
Where'd that woman go?

00:06:07.190 --> 00:06:09.480
This is enough...

00:06:10.820 --> 00:06:13.360
Kuromitsu...

00:06:14.610 --> 00:06:17.490
Any further...

00:06:18.290 --> 00:06:19.950
The head just–

00:06:22.830 --> 00:06:27.590
That man was the one who decapitated you.

00:06:28.880 --> 00:06:31.630
Not knowing where he hides...

00:06:32.340 --> 00:06:34.800
must cause you indescribable grief.

00:06:39.260 --> 00:06:40.640
That man...

00:06:40.970 --> 00:06:43.890
entered this place through his own inclination.

00:06:44.390 --> 00:06:47.560
Perhaps, he is prepared to face retribution for his iniquity.

00:06:48.690 --> 00:06:51.570
That means I have no need for restraint.

00:06:53.280 --> 00:06:54.780
Do you not agree?

00:07:05.370 --> 00:07:07.040
Have you awoken?

00:07:09.800 --> 00:07:10.880
Where...

00:07:13.260 --> 00:07:15.970
Where am I?

00:07:16.800 --> 00:07:19.720
What would you achieve even if you knew?

00:07:20.220 --> 00:07:23.720
More importantly, even your name is a mystery to you, is it not?

00:07:23.720 --> 00:07:25.190
My name?!

00:07:25.190 --> 00:07:27.730
Are you implying that I do not know my own name?!

00:07:28.150 --> 00:07:29.150
Very well!

00:07:29.900 --> 00:07:31.730
I mean...

00:07:32.030 --> 00:07:34.820
I am Benkei... Benkei.

00:07:35.490 --> 00:07:38.990
A delusion. You are Kuro.

00:07:38.990 --> 00:07:44.000
Kuro? But that is the name of my master...

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:47.330
Look upon your corporeal state.

00:07:55.920 --> 00:07:58.090
This is...

00:08:00.220 --> 00:08:05.850
Why do you desire such a siren, Kuro?

00:08:05.850 --> 00:08:07.480
That siren...

00:08:07.480 --> 00:08:11.440
who drains the blood of corpses.

00:08:11.440 --> 00:08:13.230
Kuromitsu!

00:08:13.900 --> 00:08:15.440
Indeed.

00:08:15.440 --> 00:08:19.240
Ever since I first locked eyes with her, I have craved her.

00:08:19.240 --> 00:08:22.160
When I glance her way, energy flows even to my outermost limbs!

00:08:22.160 --> 00:08:24.290
I will do anything for that woman!

00:08:24.290 --> 00:08:26.450
That thought alone drives me!

00:08:26.710 --> 00:08:31.250
You have a servant named Benkei, do you not?

00:08:31.250 --> 00:08:32.670
Benkei.

00:08:33.420 --> 00:08:35.260
That lowly grub?

00:08:35.260 --> 00:08:37.590
Compared to the embrace of Kuromitsu,

00:08:38.260 --> 00:08:41.340
my journey with him seems almost foolish!

00:08:43.510 --> 00:08:46.770
When he challenged me, he was merely an imbecile with brute strength!

00:08:47.230 --> 00:08:50.150
Then, I shall ask this only once.

00:08:50.150 --> 00:08:52.770
What name do you take?

00:08:52.770 --> 00:08:54.320
Me?

00:08:54.320 --> 00:08:56.400
My name is Kuro!

00:08:57.150 --> 00:08:58.400
Incorrect!

00:09:03.030 --> 00:09:04.450
What is the meaning of this?!

00:09:05.230 --> 00:09:07.580
What...

00:09:07.580 --> 00:09:09.580
What am I?!

00:09:09.830 --> 00:09:12.460
Your name is...

00:09:12.460 --> 00:09:14.710
My name is...?

00:09:48.200 --> 00:09:49.960
Welcome.

00:09:54.040 --> 00:09:57.550
We appreciate your presence here.

00:09:57.550 --> 00:09:59.970
We are the Overlords!

00:10:12.100 --> 00:10:15.270
My blood is draining from my body.

00:10:17.150 --> 00:10:18.530
It's phenomenal.

00:10:20.530 --> 00:10:26.660
How can being drained of blood lead to such unadulterated pleasure?

00:10:29.910 --> 00:10:32.460
The end of time?

00:10:33.370 --> 00:10:37.250
It is a place in this world where none can follow.

00:10:38.590 --> 00:10:42.170
I can travel there with you...

00:10:42.630 --> 00:10:43.720
Kuromitsu?

00:10:49.180 --> 00:10:50.470
I too had this power...

00:10:51.680 --> 00:10:54.940
bestowed upon me.

00:10:56.520 --> 00:10:59.020
It is a reminder of my past...

00:11:00.150 --> 00:11:02.240
So long ago, I have almost forgotten it.

00:11:09.740 --> 00:11:12.450
Now, you must follow my example.

00:11:12.870 --> 00:11:17.290
Pierce my neck with your teeth and imbibe my blood.

00:11:18.170 --> 00:11:19.710
If you do that...

00:11:20.670 --> 00:11:23.170
I will emerge as an immortal?

00:11:27.890 --> 00:11:28.890
Very well.

00:11:39.480 --> 00:11:40.770
Yes, like that...

00:11:41.400 --> 00:11:44.610
Drink! Drink!

00:11:45.610 --> 00:11:51.030
Drink my vitality and yours will...

00:12:02.780 --> 00:12:03.660
Are you in pain?

00:12:04.870 --> 00:12:05.790
None at all.

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:09.750
Then, why do you weep?

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:19.090
You are now... akin to me.

00:12:20.180 --> 00:12:21.400
However...

00:12:22.800 --> 00:12:25.230
I might have...

00:12:26.430 --> 00:12:30.650
I might have dragged my beloved down a heinous, dangerous path.

00:12:37.150 --> 00:12:37.990
Kuromitsu.

00:12:39.610 --> 00:12:43.830
Have I not already affirmed that I will not regret this transformation?

00:12:45.120 --> 00:12:47.590
That there is no cause to worry–

00:12:51.000 --> 00:12:52.390
What halts you so?

00:13:02.690 --> 00:13:03.770
Dearest Kuro!

00:13:04.100 --> 00:13:05.680
Do not fret!

00:13:05.680 --> 00:13:09.780
This is the natural reaction when blood coalesces.

00:13:10.100 --> 00:13:13.780
Bear the pain... Bear the pain for it will soon pass!

00:13:14.190 --> 00:13:15.740
Do not lose your senses!

00:13:26.450 --> 00:13:27.580
Dearest Kuro!

00:13:43.050 --> 00:13:44.890
Was it painful?

00:13:44.890 --> 00:13:46.610
You might well be immortal,

00:13:47.430 --> 00:13:50.240
but I suspect you experience pain like everyone else.

00:13:51.940 --> 00:13:57.270
Countless days have passed since our fates became inexplicably entwined...

00:13:57.270 --> 00:14:01.910
You are the inkling of immortality that's finally within my grasp.

00:14:02.530 --> 00:14:06.530
Can you fathom how long I have waited for this very moment?

00:14:14.210 --> 00:14:18.600
Show me the testament of immortality
through this punctured stomach of yours.

00:14:20.980 --> 00:14:25.190
Show me its manifestation!

00:14:40.690 --> 00:14:42.110
Impossible!

00:14:42.110 --> 00:14:43.750
You breathe yet, Yoshitsune?!

00:16:34.600 --> 00:16:35.730
Dearest Kuro!

00:16:36.020 --> 00:16:36.850
Kuromitsu.

00:16:40.980 --> 00:16:41.940
Are you injured?

00:16:44.150 --> 00:16:47.910
You should not move yet...

00:16:48.610 --> 00:16:51.820
or else, your wound will open again.

00:16:52.700 --> 00:16:55.120
Our blood...

00:16:55.790 --> 00:16:59.290
has not yet merged sufficiently.

00:17:00.460 --> 00:17:03.680
What is this power I possess?

00:17:04.590 --> 00:17:09.050
It is your blood. All this power is because of your blood.

00:17:09.590 --> 00:17:10.940
My blood...

00:17:24.150 --> 00:17:26.940
The secret of immortality is... blood?

00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:31.070
If I drink the blood of an immortal...

00:17:31.070 --> 00:17:33.540
I shall possess the power of immortality?

00:17:34.200 --> 00:17:36.750
If I drink the blood of this harlot...

00:17:37.370 --> 00:17:41.160
I shall become immortal?!

00:17:58.180 --> 00:17:59.150
Benkei?!

00:17:59.890 --> 00:18:01.140
Where have you been?

00:18:01.680 --> 00:18:04.660
Forgive me, my lord.

00:18:05.020 --> 00:18:09.190
I never imagined events would take this course,

00:18:09.190 --> 00:18:12.410
so I journeyed as far as Hiraizumi.

00:18:14.420 --> 00:18:18.120
Come, our pursuers are closing in.

00:18:18.120 --> 00:18:19.990
We cannot delay a moment longer...

00:18:20.580 --> 00:18:22.080
Lady Kuromitsu...

00:18:22.080 --> 00:18:26.920
Do you know of a path down the mountain that will hide us until daybreak?

00:18:26.920 --> 00:18:27.710
I do.

00:18:28.710 --> 00:18:30.210
Let us attempt this route.

00:18:31.090 --> 00:18:31.930
However...

00:18:36.800 --> 00:18:38.070
Are you troubled?

00:18:42.770 --> 00:18:43.980
What ails you?

00:18:45.980 --> 00:18:46.660
Dearest Kuro!

00:18:58.700 --> 00:19:01.450
Why, Benkei?

00:19:03.250 --> 00:19:05.960
What reason have you...?

00:19:08.790 --> 00:19:09.960
Kuromitsu...

00:19:12.210 --> 00:19:15.090
Are we to be separated?

00:19:17.020 --> 00:19:20.760
Dearest Kuro!

00:19:39.160 --> 00:19:44.880
When did I fall into slumber?

00:19:46.830 --> 00:19:48.000
That maiden...

00:19:50.960 --> 00:19:54.140
Where is... Kuromitsu?

00:20:13.180 --> 00:20:28.240
Next Chapter

00:20:18.340 --> 00:20:28.240
Asuka
